LigoWave MIBs from the vendor's LigoDLB MIB bundle:
https://www.ligowave.com/wiki/faq/ligodlb-how-to-find-oids/

The module filenames are normalized to their module names. No MIB definitions
were otherwise edited. FROGFOOT-RESOURCES-MIB from the bundle is omitted because
it defines a separate Frogfoot enterprise tree and is not imported by the
LigoWave modules used for device support.
